N </span><span lang=\"EN-US\">=</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"> 12; <span>&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></span></pre><pre><b><span lang=\"EN-US\">IRrecv</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\"> irrecv(RECV_PIN); <span>&nbsp;</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></pre><pre><b><span lang=\"EN-US\">decode_results</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\"> results; &nbsp; </span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></pre><pre><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></pre><pre><span lang=\"EN-US\">void</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\">setup</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">(){<o:p></o:p></span></pre><pre><span lang=\"EN-US\"> &nbsp;</span><b><span lang=\"EN-US\">Serial</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\">.</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">begin</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">(9600); &nbsp;&nbsp;<span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span>&nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></span></pre><pre><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span>&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;irrecv</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">.</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">enableIRIn</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">();<span>&nbsp; </span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></pre><pre><span lang=\"EN-US\">}<o:p></o:p></span></pre><pre><span lang=\"EN-US\">void</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\">loop</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">() {<o:p></o:p></span></pre><pre><span lang=\"EN-US\"> &nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">if</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"> (irrecv</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">.</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">decode</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">&amp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">results)) {<span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span>&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></span></pre><pre><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span>&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><b><span lang=\"EN-US\">Serial</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\">.</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">println</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">(results</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">.</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">value</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\">HEX</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">); <span>&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></span></pre><pre><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span>&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;irrecv</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">.</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">resume</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">();<span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span>&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></span></pre><pre><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span>&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;}<o:p></o:p></span></pre><pre><span lang=\"EN-US\"> &nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">delay</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">(100);<o:p></o:p></span></pre><pre><span lang=\"EN-US\">}</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></pre>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><b><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span>一、</span></span></b><!--[endif]--><b><span>评分组成<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>实操题总分<span lang=\"EN-US\">100</span>分，由两部分组成，分别为：</span><b><span>电路搭设</span></b><span>和</span><b><span>功能呈现</span></b><span>。其中电路搭设分值<span lang=\"EN-US\">20</span>分，功能呈现<span lang=\"EN-US\">80</span>分。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></b></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><b><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span>二、</span></span></b><!--[endif]--><b><span>电路搭设评分<span lang=\"EN-US\"> -- </span>总分<span lang=\"EN-US\">20</span>分<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"1\"><b><span>原器件：<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span>1.<span>&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span>装置中包含<span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span>个<span lang=\"EN-US\">LED</span>灯模块或<span lang=\"EN-US\">LED</span>灯，得<span lang=\"EN-US\">4</span>分<span lang=\"EN-US\">;<o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span>2.<span>&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span>装置中包含红外遥控器和红外接受模块，得<span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span>分<span lang=\"EN-US\">;<o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span>3.<span>&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span>装置中包含舵机，得<span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span>分<span lang=\"EN-US\">;<o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"1\"><b><span>电路搭设：<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span>4.<span>&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">LED</span><span>灯模块或<span lang=\"EN-US\">LED</span>灯和主控板正确连接，得<span lang=\"EN-US\">4</span>分<span lang=\"EN-US\">;<o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span>5.<span>&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span>红外接受模块和主控板正确连接，得<span lang=\"EN-US\">4</span>分<span lang=\"EN-US\">;<o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span>6.<span>&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span>舵机和主控板正确连接，得<span lang=\"EN-US\">4</span>分<span lang=\"EN-US\">;<o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><b><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span>三、</span></span></b><!--[endif]--><b><span>程序功能呈现<span lang=\"EN-US\"> -- </span>总分<span lang=\"EN-US\">80</span>分<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span>1、</span></span><!--[endif]--><span>装置通电启动后，门锁关闭，此时<span lang=\"EN-US\">LED_A</span>点亮，<span lang=\"EN-US\">LED_B</span>熄灭，舵机处于<span lang=\"EN-US\">45</span>度位置，得<span lang=\"EN-US\">10</span>分。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span>2、</span></span><!--[endif]--><span>当点击红外遥控器的“<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>”键时，舵机处于<span lang=\"EN-US\">135</span>度位置，得<span lang=\"EN-US\">10</span>分。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span>3、</span></span><!--[endif]--><span>当点击红外遥控器的“<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>”键时，<span lang=\"EN-US\">LED_A</span>熄灭，<span lang=\"EN-US\">LED_B</span>点亮，得<span lang=\"EN-US\">10</span>分。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span>4、</span></span><!--[endif]--><span>当点击红外遥控器的“<span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span>”键时，此时舵机处于<span lang=\"EN-US\">45</span>度位置，得<span lang=\"EN-US\">10</span>分。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span>5、</span></span><!--[endif]--><span>当点击红外遥控器的“<span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span>”键时，<span lang=\"EN-US\">LED_A</span>点亮，<span lang=\"EN-US\">LED_B</span>熄灭，得<span lang=\"EN-US\">10</span>分。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span>6、</span></span><!--[endif]--><span>当点击红外遥控器其它任一按键时，<span lang=\"EN-US\">LED_A</span>和<span lang=\"EN-US\">LED_B</span>均闪烁，得<span lang=\"EN-US\">10</span>分。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span>7、</span></span><!--[endif]--><span>当连续点击红外遥控的其它按键超过<span lang=\"EN-US\">3</span>次时，此时<span lang=\"EN-US\">LED_A</span>和<span lang=\"EN-US\">LED_B</span>均熄灭，整个装置处于锁定状态，不再对任何红外按键输入做出反应，得<span lang=\"EN-US\">20</span>分。（判断该项得分时，要求考生先连续点击其它按键<span lang=\"EN-US\">3</span>次，观察<span lang=\"EN-US\">LED_A</span>和<span lang=\"EN-US\">LED_B</span>是否熄灭后，再要求考生点击“<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>”键或“<span lang=\"EN-US\">2”</span>键，舵机及<span lang=\"EN-US\">LED</span>灯没有反应，方可得分）。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p><br><p></p>","an":"<p>初始化Atmega328P主控板，包含设置舵机控制引脚、LED_A和LED_B的输出引脚、红外接收模块的输入引脚。引入Servo.h和IRremote.h库文件，创建Servo对象并关联舵机引脚。设定初始状态：舵机置于45度，LED_A高电平，LED_B低电平。在主循环中检测红外信号，判断按键值是否为‘1’或‘2’，对应控制舵机转动至135度或45度，并同步更新LED状态。若按键非‘1’或‘2’，LED_A和LED_B进入闪烁模式，记录异常按键次数。当异常按键累计超过3次，关闭LED输出，锁定系统响应。所有状态切换需确保引脚电平与任务要求一致，延时控制用于信号稳定性。</p>","sc":100.0,"kp":["使用输出数字脉冲信号的传感器，如超声波测距传感器、红外遥控信号接收传感器","通过控制器I/O口实现数字信号、模拟信号的读写","程序设计的三种基本结构、自定义函数","变量及变量的作用域","数学、比较及逻辑运算","类库概念、安装及使用","通过编程控制伺服电机（舵机）实现指定转动"]},{"i":"6015","no":2,"t":4,"s":"<p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">功能呈现<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>）装置通电启动后，门锁关闭，此时<span lang=\"EN-US\">LED_A</span>点亮，<span lang=\"EN-US\">LED_B</span>熄灭，舵机处于<span lang=\"EN-US\">45</span>度位置；（<span lang=\"EN-US\">10</span>分）<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span>）当点击红外遥控器的<span lang=\"EN-US\">“1”</span>键时，舵机处于<span lang=\"EN-US\">135</span>度位置；（<span lang=\"EN-US\">10</span>分）<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">3</span>）当点击红外遥控器的<span lang=\"EN-US\">“1”</span>键时，<span lang=\"EN-US\">LED_A</span>熄灭，<span lang=\"EN-US\">LED_B</span>点亮；（<span lang=\"EN-US\">10</span>分）<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">4</span>）当点击红外遥控器的<span lang=\"EN-US\">“2”</span>键时，此时舵机处于<span lang=\"EN-US\">45</span>度位置；（<span lang=\"EN-US\">10</span>分）<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">5</span>）当点击红外遥控器的<span lang=\"EN-US\">“2”</span>键时，<span lang=\"EN-US\">LED_A</span>点亮，<span lang=\"EN-US\">LED_B</span>熄灭；（<span lang=\"EN-US\">10</span>分）<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">6</span>）当点击红外遥控器其它任一按键时，<span lang=\"EN-US\">LED_A</span>和<span lang=\"EN-US\">LED_B</span>均闪烁；（<span lang=\"EN-US\">10</span>分）<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">（<span lang=\"EN-US\">7</span>）当连续点击红外遥控的其它按键超过<span lang=\"EN-US\">3</span>次时，此时<span lang=\"EN-US\">LED_A</span>和<span lang=\"EN-US\">LED_B</span>均熄灭，整个装置处于锁定状态，不再对任何红外按键输入做出反应。（<span lang=\"EN-US\">20</span>分）<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">说明：判断该项得分时，要求考生先连续点击其它按键<span lang=\"EN-US\">3</span>次，观察<span lang=\"EN-US\">LED_A</span>和<span lang=\"EN-US\">LED_B</span>是否熄灭后，再要求考生点击<span lang=\"EN-US\">“1”</span>键或<span lang=\"EN-US\">“2”</span>键，舵机及<span lang=\"EN-US\">LED</span>灯没有反应，方可得分。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><br></p>","o":[],"a":"<p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span>主题：红外遥控门锁<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span>器件</span></b><span>：</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">Atmega328P</span><span>主控板<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>块，<span lang=\"EN-US\">LED</span>模块<span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span>个（<span lang=\"EN-US\">LED_A</span>和<span lang=\"EN-US\">LED_B</span>），红外遥控器和红外接收模块各<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>个，舵机<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>个及相应辅件。以上模块也可使用分立器件结合面包板搭建。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span>任务要求：</span></b><b><span> <span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>通过红外遥控器控制舵机的转动，当舵机处于不同的转动位置时，分别表示门锁的打开和关闭。具体任务说明及要求如下：<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span>1、</span></span><!--[endif]--><span>当舵机处于<span lang=\"EN-US\">45</span>度位置时，表示门锁处于关闭状态；当舵机处于<span lang=\"EN-US\">135</span>度位置时，表示门锁处于打开状态。当门锁处于关闭状态时，<span lang=\"EN-US\">LED_A</span>点亮，<span lang=\"EN-US\">LED_B</span>熄灭。当门锁处于打开状态时，<span lang=\"EN-US\">LED_A</span>熄灭，<span lang=\"EN-US\">LED_B</span>点亮。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span>2、</span></span><!--[endif]--><span>当项目装置启动时，门锁默认处于关闭状态。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span>3、</span></span><!--[endif]--><span>当点击红外遥控器的“<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>”键时，门锁打开。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span>4、</span></span><!--[endif]--><span>当点击红外遥控器的“<span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span>”键时，门锁关闭。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span>5、</span></span><!--[endif]--><span>当点击红外遥控的其它按键时，门锁不做反应，此时<span lang=\"EN-US\">LED_A</span>和<span lang=\"EN-US\">LED_B</span>均闪烁。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span>6、</span></span><!--[endif]--><span>当连续点击红外遥控的其它按键超过<span lang=\"EN-US\">3</span>次时，门锁不做反应，此时<span lang=\"EN-US\">LED_A</span>和<span lang=\"EN-US\">LED_B</span>均熄灭，整个装置处于锁定状态，不再对任何红外按键输入做出反应。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span>7、</span></span><!--[endif]--><span>控制程序采用<span lang=\"EN-US\">Arduino C/C++</span>代码编写，不得使用图形化软件编写。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span>8、</span></span><!--[endif]--><span>未作规定处可自行处理，无明显与事实违背即可。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span>9、</span></span><!--[endif]--><span>考试结束，考生将代码压缩上传，程序文件命名规则为：<span lang=\"EN-US\">DJKS4_</span>身份证号。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span>10、</span></span><!--[endif]--><span>程序编写过程中不得打开库例程和其它程序，如发现，实操成绩按照<span lang=\"EN-US\">0</span>分处理。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span>说明：</span></b><span>舵机</span><span>类库</span><span>及常用成员</span><span>函数如下，供参考。</span><span>红外遥控提供示例供参考。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>舵机类库：</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>头文件：</span><b><span lang=\"EN-US\">Servo</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\">.</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">h</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>类库对象：</span><b><span lang=\"EN-US\">Servo</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>成员函数：</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span>&nbsp; </span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\">attach</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">(Pin)<span>&nbsp; </span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>//</span><span>指定引脚的关联引脚</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">write</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">(angle)<span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>//</span><span>功能是让舵机转动到指定的角度</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>红外遥控例程：</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<pre><span lang=\"EN-US\">#include</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\">&lt;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">IRremote</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">.</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">h</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">&gt;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"> &nbsp;&nbsp;<span>&nbsp; </span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></pre><pre><span lang=\"EN-US\">const</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\">int</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"> RECV_PIN </span><span lang=\"EN-US\">=</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"> 12; <span>&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></span></pre><pre><b><span lang=\"EN-US\">IRrecv</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\"> irrecv(RECV_PIN); <span>&nbsp;</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></pre><pre><b><span lang=\"EN-US\">decode_results</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\"> results; &nbsp; </span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></pre><pre><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></pre><pre><span lang=\"EN-US\">void</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\">setup</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">(){<o:p></o:p></span></pre><pre><span lang=\"EN-US\"> &nbsp;</span><b><span lang=\"EN-US\">Serial</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\">.</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">begin</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">(9600); &nbsp;&nbsp;<span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span>&nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></span></pre><pre><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span>&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;irrecv</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">.</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">enableIRIn</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">();<span>&nbsp; </span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></pre><pre><span lang=\"EN-US\">}<o:p></o:p></span></pre><pre><span lang=\"EN-US\">void</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\">loop</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">() {<o:p></o:p></span></pre><pre><span lang=\"EN-US\"> &nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">if</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"> (irrecv</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">.</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">decode</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">&amp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">results)) {<span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span>&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></span></pre><pre><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span>&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><b><span lang=\"EN-US\">Serial</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\">.</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">println</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">(results</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">.</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">value</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">,</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\">HEX</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">); <span>&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></span></pre><pre><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span>&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;irrecv</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">.</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">resume</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">();<span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span>&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></span></pre><pre><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span>&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;}<o:p></o:p></span></pre><pre><span lang=\"EN-US\"> &nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">delay</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">(100);<o:p></o:p></span></pre><pre><span lang=\"EN-US\">}</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></pre>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><b><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span>一、</span></span></b><!--[endif]--><b><span>评分组成<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>实操题总分<span lang=\"EN-US\">100</span>分，由两部分组成，分别为：</span><b><span>电路搭设</span></b><span>和</span><b><span>功能呈现</span></b><span>。其中电路搭设分值<span lang=\"EN-US\">20</span>分，功能呈现<span lang=\"EN-US\">80</span>分。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></b></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><b><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span>二、</span></span></b><!--[endif]--><b><span>电路搭设评分<span lang=\"EN-US\"> -- </span>总分<span lang=\"EN-US\">20</span>分<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"1\"><b><span>原器件：<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span>1.<span>&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span>装置中包含<span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span>个<span lang=\"EN-US\">LED</span>灯模块或<span lang=\"EN-US\">LED</span>灯，得<span lang=\"EN-US\">4</span>分<span lang=\"EN-US\">;<o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span>2.<span>&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span>装置中包含红外遥控器和红外接受模块，得<span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span>分<span lang=\"EN-US\">;<o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span>3.<span>&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span>装置中包含舵机，得<span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span>分<span lang=\"EN-US\">;<o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"1\"><b><span>电路搭设：<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span>4.<span>&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">LED</span><span>灯模块或<span lang=\"EN-US\">LED</span>灯和主控板正确连接，得<span lang=\"EN-US\">4</span>分<span lang=\"EN-US\">;<o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span>5.<span>&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span>红外接受模块和主控板正确连接，得<span lang=\"EN-US\">4</span>分<span lang=\"EN-US\">;<o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"1\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span>6.<span>&nbsp;&nbsp;\r\n</span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span>舵机和主控板正确连接，得<span lang=\"EN-US\">4</span>分<span lang=\"EN-US\">;<o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><b><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span>三、</span></span></b><!--[endif]--><b><span>程序功能呈现<span lang=\"EN-US\"> -- </span>总分<span lang=\"EN-US\">80</span>分<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></b></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span>1、</span></span><!--[endif]--><span>装置通电启动后，门锁关闭，此时<span lang=\"EN-US\">LED_A</span>点亮，<span lang=\"EN-US\">LED_B</span>熄灭，舵机处于<span lang=\"EN-US\">45</span>度位置，得<span lang=\"EN-US\">10</span>分。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span>2、</span></span><!--[endif]--><span>当点击红外遥控器的“<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>”键时，舵机处于<span lang=\"EN-US\">135</span>度位置，得<span lang=\"EN-US\">10</span>分。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span>3、</span></span><!--[endif]--><span>当点击红外遥控器的“<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>”键时，<span lang=\"EN-US\">LED_A</span>熄灭，<span lang=\"EN-US\">LED_B</span>点亮，得<span lang=\"EN-US\">10</span>分。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span>4、</span></span><!--[endif]--><span>当点击红外遥控器的“<span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span>”键时，此时舵机处于<span lang=\"EN-US\">45</span>度位置，得<span lang=\"EN-US\">10</span>分。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span>5、</span></span><!--[endif]--><span>当点击红外遥控器的“<span lang=\"EN-US\">2</span>”键时，<span lang=\"EN-US\">LED_A</span>点亮，<span lang=\"EN-US\">LED_B</span>熄灭，得<span lang=\"EN-US\">10</span>分。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span>6、</span></span><!--[endif]--><span>当点击红外遥控器其它任一按键时，<span lang=\"EN-US\">LED_A</span>和<span lang=\"EN-US\">LED_B</span>均闪烁，得<span lang=\"EN-US\">10</span>分。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span>7、</span></span><!--[endif]--><span>当连续点击红外遥控的其它按键超过<span lang=\"EN-US\">3</span>次时，此时<span lang=\"EN-US\">LED_A</span>和<span lang=\"EN-US\">LED_B</span>均熄灭，整个装置处于锁定状态，不再对任何红外按键输入做出反应，得<span lang=\"EN-US\">20</span>分。（判断该项得分时，要求考生先连续点击其它按键<span lang=\"EN-US\">3</span>次，观察<span lang=\"EN-US\">LED_A</span>和<span lang=\"EN-US\">LED_B</span>是否熄灭后，再要求考生点击“<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>”键或“<span lang=\"EN-US\">2”</span>键，舵机及<span lang=\"EN-US\">LED</span>灯没有反应，方可得分）。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p><br></p>","an":"<p>初始化系统，配置LED_A、LED_B、舵机及红外接收模块。设置舵机初始角度为45度，点亮LED_A，熄灭LED_B。进入主循环，持续检测红外按键输入。当接收到‘1’键时，将舵机旋转至135度，同时切换LED状态为LED_A灭、LED_B亮。当接收到‘2’键时，将舵机旋转至45度，同时切换LED状态为LED_A亮、LED_B灭。当接收到非‘1’和‘2’的其他按键时，记录按键次数并使两LED闪烁。若其他按键累计触发超过3次，则关闭两LED，进入锁定状态，并屏蔽后续所有红外按键响应。</p>","sc":100.0,"kp":["使用输出数字脉冲信号的传感器，如超声波测距传感器、红外遥控信号接收传感器","通过编程控制伺服电机（舵机）实现指定转动","程序设计的三种基本结构、自定义函数","变量及变量的作用域","数学、比较及逻辑运算","类库概念、安装及使用","模拟量、数字量、I/O口输入输出等概念"]}]